  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When a user deletes a resource a tomstone is put in its place.  Users have expressed a desire be able to \"undelete\"   the deleted resource.   To this end,  several things must be considered/implemented.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Resources that were not created as \"versionable\" cannot be undeleted.",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "When a resource is deleted,  a memento of the resource's state just before deletion should be created (otherwise there will be nothing to restore should the need arise).",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "The timemap should be preserved when a resource is deleted.",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "It should be possible to restore a memento  via a GET on the desired version followed by PUT on against the tombstone resource.",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "We may need to employ a Prefer header such as \"Prefer: ignore-tombstone\"  in order to get bypass the tombstone's 415 response on a PUT.",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "orderedList"
    }
   ],
